{"id":102114,"date":"2026-01-18T21:05:04","date_gmt":"2026-01-18T21:05:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/viejocreekoutdoors.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=102114"},"modified":"2026-02-12T21:05:10","modified_gmt":"2026-02-12T21:05:10","slug":"cajun-creek-seasoning","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/viejocreekoutdoors.com\/product\/cajun-creek-seasoning\/","title":{"rendered":"Cajun Creek Seasoning"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"850\">Bring rich, down-home flavor to your kitchen or campfire with <strong data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"811\">Cajun Creek Seasoning<\/strong>, proudly made by Viejo Creek Outdoors.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"1172\">This all-purpose seasoning is designed for cooks who want dependable flavor whether they\u2019re grilling, smoking, pan-searing, or cooking over an open flame. Cajun Creek Seasoning delivers a balanced, savory kick that enhances food without overpowering it\u2014making it a staple for everyday meals and outdoor adventures alike.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1186\">Perfect for:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1333\">\n<li data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1225\">\n<p data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1225\">Beef, chicken, pork, and wild game<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1255\">\n<p data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1255\">Fish, shrimp, and seafood<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1291\">\n<p data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1291\">Vegetables, potatoes, and sides<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1333\">\n<p data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1333\">Grilling, smoking, frying, and baking<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1354\">Available Sizes<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1407\">\n<li data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1381\">\n<p data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1381\"><strong data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1379\">8oz Shaker \u2013 $7.95<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1407\">\n<p data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1407\"><strong data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1407\">16oz Shaker \u2013 $10.95<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1552\">Whether you\u2019re seasoning dinner at home or cooking in the great outdoors, Cajun Creek Seasoning is built to perform wherever good food is made.<\/p>\n<blockquote data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1606\">\n<p data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1606\"><strong data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1606\">Seasoning details and ingredients coming soon.<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Cajun Creek Seasoning by Viejo Creek Outdoors is a bold, versatile blend crafted for everyday cooking and outdoor grilling. Available in <strong data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"518\">8oz<\/strong> and <strong data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"531\">16oz<\/strong> sizes, it\u2019s the go-to seasoning for adding authentic Cajun-style flavor to meats, seafood, vegetables, and more.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":102111,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_et_pb_use_builder":"","_et_pb_old_content":"","_et_gb_content_width":""},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[95],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-102114","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-food","pa_seasoning-16oz","pa_seasoning-8oz","first","instock","taxable","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-variable"],"jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/viejocreekoutdoors.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product\/102114","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/viejocreekoutdoors.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/viejocreekoutdoors.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/product"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/viejocreekoutdoors.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=102114"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/viejocreekoutd